          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 无法在打开此操作前保存当前编辑器。%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium does not claim that a multi-file operation is atomic across vaults or filesystems. These durable records identify what was restored and what still needs inspection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium does not claim that a multi-file operation is atomic across vaults or filesystems. These durable records identify what was restored and what still needs inspection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 不保证跨研究库或文件系统的多文件操作具有原子性。这些持久记录会说明已恢复的内容以及仍需检查的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium first creates Before Restore. Files created after this checkpoint move to Trash; files changed, moved, or deleted are restored from the selected checkpoint." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium first creates Before Restore. Files created after this checkpoint move to Trash; files changed, moved, or deleted are restored from the selected checkpoint."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 会先创建“恢复前”恢复点。在此恢复点之后创建的文件将移入纸篓；更改、移动或删除的文件将从所选恢复点恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium found no matching derived issues. Timed dismissals return after %@; Leave Unchanged returns only for a later Material revision or when restored in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Scholium found no matching derived issues. Timed dismissals return after %@; Leave Unchanged returns only for a later Material revision or when restored in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scholium 未发现匹配的派生问题。定时忽略的项目会在 %@ 后返回；“保持不变”仅会在材料出现后续修订或在设置中恢复时返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scholium found no matching derived issues. Timed dismissals return after %arg; Leave Unchanged returns only for a later Material revision or when restored in Settings." : {
